  "usage_note": "Estonian sports media write the club without quotes and decline it like an -is noun (Žalgiris : Žalgirise : Žalgirist), e.g. 'Kaunase Žalgirise vastu', 'kaotas Žalgirisele'. The city stays in the genitive (Kaunase) and only Žalgiris takes case endings. The original Lithuanian spelling is kept, with the letter Ž. In running copy the short form 'Žalgiris' is usual after the first mention."
